From 06e146142fc2e9eb1125e395644c383d6ebd73fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 03:20:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Sync Bedrock exporter with base/ pack

- Generators now reproduce base/ exactly (61 JSON files verified)
- Comets: coma + tail particles, 40 d fade, elongation fade, orbit offset, leap-day term
- Emitter gets the zoomed state; planets get hires config; moon/sun/starfield match base
- Manifest uses base UUIDs/versions; add lighting, texture sets, calendar geometry
- Export vanilla sun/moon overrides, MER maps, calendar atlas, comet/planet PNGs from base/
- Drop entity.material and the vanilla player render controller override
- Preview treats starfield:sun_moon as additive (derives from particles_add)
- Add verify:export and sync:base scripts; sync public/particles from base/
